#: manifest.json motion.slint:24
msgid "NVIDIA Motion Smoothing"
msgstr "NVIDIA 运动平滑"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Smoother motion with real in-between frames from your NVIDIA GeForce RTX GPU"
msgstr "用 NVIDIA GeForce RTX GPU 生成真实的中间帧，让画面运动更流畅"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Doubles the video's frame rate while it plays, with in-between frames made from the optical flow that the hardware of your NVIDIA GeForce RTX 30 series or newer GPU measures between frames: not blended frames. Video ▸ NVIDIA Motion Smoothing… opens a window to choose Off, Double Frame Rate or Match Display (the doubled frames paced to the display, with GPU rendering) and shows what runs or why not. Needs Windows with an RTX 30 series or newer GPU and NVIDIA driver 573.38 or newer; it does nothing on other GPUs or systems. Off by default; remembers your choice.\n"
"→ Menu: Video ▸ NVIDIA Motion Smoothing"
msgstr ""
"播放时把视频帧率提高一倍，中间帧根据 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 30 系列或更新 GPU 的硬件在两帧之间测得的光流生成，而不是两帧混合。“视频 ▸ NVIDIA 运动平滑…”打开一个窗口，可选“关”“双倍帧率”或“匹配显示器”（双倍后的帧再按显示器刷新率输出，需 GPU 渲染），并显示当前效果或不能使用的原因。需要装有 RTX 30 系列或更新 GPU、NVIDIA 驱动 573.38 或更新版本的 Windows；在其他 GPU 或系统上不起作用。默认关闭，会记住你的选择。\n"
"→ 菜单：视频 ▸ NVIDIA 运动平滑"

