#: motion.slint:53
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: motion.slint:70
msgid "Double Frame Rate shows twice the frames, with real in-between frames made from the GPU's optical flow. Match Display also paces them to the display (GPU rendering only). Doubling makes film look like video, so it is off by default."
msgstr "“双倍帧率”显示两倍的帧，中间帧根据 GPU 的光流真实生成。“匹配显示器”还会按显示器刷新率输出（仅 GPU 渲染）。帧率翻倍会让电影看起来像录像，所以默认关闭。"

#: motion.slint:103
msgid "Needs Windows with an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 30 series or newer GPU and NVIDIA driver 573.38 or newer. The player decides what the GPU can keep up with: large or fast videos are not offered."
msgstr "需要装有 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 30 系列或更新 GPU、NVIDIA 驱动 573.38 或更新版本的 Windows。播放器会判断 GPU 能否跟上：过大或帧率过高的视频不提供此功能。"

#: motion.slint:109
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"
